# capture_evidence.py may emit more than one state-NNNN.json snapshot per role
# (e.g. failure/ gets one from the pre-intervention settle() and one from the
# terminal fail() path) -- a per-file allow-rule silently drops whichever exact
# sequence number a future recapture happens to produce. This blanket rule
# covers every role directory above so a fresh clone never falls behind
# manifest.json's own file list; scripts/preflight.py additionally asserts
# every manifest-listed path is git-tracked when run inside a checkout.
!/evidence/*/state-*.json

